Z||000002||My7Fieros||04-18-2001||01:47 AM||||First thing you need to do is.......use punctuation in your post. Ok, with that said, yeah check your fuel pressure. Its gotta be getting a good spark judging from everything youve done. Your fuel pump may be heading south. May also just be the fuel pump relay. At any rate, sounds like a fuel delivery prob. Good luck. M7F||||reg||1
