Z||000007||Jncomutt||04-18-2001||11:39 AM||||My 86 4cyl kept shutting off on me on the ride home from work one day.  Found the problem to be in a loose and corroded battery cable.  From what you went through, doesn't seem like it would be the problem.  Just thought you might not want to overlook the simple fix it took for me.||||reg||1
